    "text": "The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> for which both the roots of the equation <math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>-</mo> <msup> <mi>a</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced> <msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mi>a</mi> <mi>x</mi> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mo>=</mo> <mn>0 </mn> </mrow> </math> lie between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>, will always be greater than&nbsp;",
